.PS
# basic/trpwl.cir drawn: a piecewise-linear source (G₁) and an
# exponential one (G₂), each into its own RC low-pass (tau = 100 ns
# both). Card order kept; deck nodes 1 In1, 2 Out1, 3 In2, 4 Out2.
spice = 1
In1:  (0.3,1.5)
Out1: (1.5,1.5)
In2:  (2.5,1.5)
Out2: (3.7,1.5)

V1: vsource(In1, (0.3,0), pwl(0 0 1u 1 2u 1 3u -1 5u 0), "G₁")
R1: resistor(In1, Out1, 1k)
C1: capacitor(Out1, (1.5,0), 100p)
V2: vsource(In2, (2.5,0), exp(0 2 0.5u 0.3u 2.5u 0.6u), "G₂")
R2: resistor(In2, Out2, 500)
C2: capacitor(Out2, (3.7,0), 200p)

line from V1.N to C2.N
dot at C1.N; dot at V2.N
ground((0.9,0))
.tran 0.02u 6u
.PE
